    ["<Assistant_Title1>【六只鸽子】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>廷根街头有个疯疯癫癫的老太太，总是说绅士的帽子里有鸽子……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[廷根(890,775)]|-11029;-22567;-1284;2;5200002;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>老妇人</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Six Pigeons】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There is a crazy old lady on the streets of Tingen who always says there are pigeons in a gentleman's hat...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the Advancement Quest, then advance to Sequence 7, go to {Location:[Tingen(890,775)]|-11029;-22567;-1284;2;5200002;0}, and speak with the <Assistant_Red>Old Woman</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoice Receipt",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【正义钱包】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>防御类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>通用倾向封印物，直接降低受到的伤害，并在承伤时根据累计伤害提高<Assistant_Red>防御值</>；持有防御提升效果超过一定时间且仍处于战斗中时，会周期性进入<Assistant_Red>不堪重负</>状态，降低移动速度和体力恢复速度。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁封印物，无需额外获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Justice Wallet】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Defense-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A general-purpose Sealed Artifact. Directly reduces damage taken and increases <Assistant_Red>Defense value</> based on cumulative damage when taking hits. When holding the defense boost effect for more than a certain time while still in combat, you will periodically enter an <Assistant_Red>Overwhelmed</> state, reducing movement speed and stamina recovery speed.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Default unlocked Sealed Artifact, no additional acquisition required.",
